    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/d996a34baaf2b05c26a4540da09ba0b2.avif?t=1746226202\" width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fateful Destiny</strong> is a short narrative-driven adventure set in a small village where mystery lurks beneath the surface. Playing as a young farmer, you\u2019ll uncover the story by exploring the town, speaking to its inhabitants, and piecing together clues. Designed to be completed in about twenty minutes, it offers a unique experience: decisions are final, and once finished, it\u2019s not meant to be played again. Every choice shapes your understanding of the truth in this fleeting yet impactful journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/ff4b11dfe2a4e3e1b05a02d88309d769.poster.avif?t=1746226202\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/ff4b11dfe2a4e3e1b05a02d88309d769.webm?t=1746226202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/ff4b11dfe2a4e3e1b05a02d88309d769.mp4?t=1746226202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/d996a34baaf2b05c26a4540da09ba0b2.avif?t=1746226202\" width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fateful Destiny</strong> is a short narrative-driven adventure set in a small village where mystery lurks beneath the surface. Playing as a young farmer, you\u2019ll uncover the story by exploring the town, speaking to its inhabitants, and piecing together clues. Designed to be completed in about twenty minutes, it offers a unique experience: decisions are final, and once finished, it\u2019s not meant to be played again. Every choice shapes your understanding of the truth in this fleeting yet impactful journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/ff4b11dfe2a4e3e1b05a02d88309d769.poster.avif?t=1746226202\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/ff4b11dfe2a4e3e1b05a02d88309d769.webm?t=1746226202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359560/extras/ff4b11dfe2a4e3e1b05a02d88309d769.mp4?t=1746226202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
